Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.45,0:00:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just looking at your job post\Nright here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is 100% right up my alley
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.75,0:00:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I have direct experience\Nworking on this type of project
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we head over\Nto my profile right here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see that I've never had a bad review
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've done a lot of work on Upwork
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can even see real examples\Nof me building automations right here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have a 100% Job Success Score
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means I've constantly delivered results\Nfor my previous clients
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to work with you too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to introduce myself\Nand give you a better idea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of who's behind the proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for taking the time to watch, speak soon!
